@startuml get-manager-consent-type-version-status
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/consent/{type}/{version}/status
caption CRB-39 · 버전별 동의 · 철회 현황. admin도 조회 가능

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerConsentController" as Controller
participant "ManagerConsentService" as Service
participant "AdminConsentRepository" as AdminConsentRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/consent/{type}/{version}/status\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt path 검증 실패 (type · version 형식 · 길이)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: getStatus(params)
Controller -> Service: getStatus(type, version)
Service -> AdminConsentRepository: exists(type, version)
AdminConsentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT consent WHERE type, version
PostgreSQL --> AdminConsentRepository: row | 0행
alt 0행
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Consent version not found.
end
Service -> AdminConsentRepository: countStatus(type, version)
AdminConsentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT user_consent JOIN users\n사용자별로 묶어 유효한 동의 여부와 탈퇴 여부로 집계
note right: 철회 후 재동의하면 행이 2개라 행이 아니라 사용자를 셈.\n세 값은 겹치지 않음
PostgreSQL --> AdminConsentRepository: agreed, revoked, withdrawn
Service --> Controller: ConsentStatusDto
Controller --> Client: 200 { type, version, agreed_count, revoked_count, withdrawn_count }

@enduml
